ethod obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/12/19/50494840/e471b185a0f141291f3a8a72bca1c00d_2165196442200561410.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">303</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">9</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">千载东风吹世换，算来几梦浮生。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">转蓬飞絮复宵征。依依多少事，转眼芜已平。</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">世如烘炉</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:17秒]展开一个持续5秒的领域，处于该领域内自身造成的全伤害提高20.0%，该效果在离开领域后仍能持续10秒，重复触发刷新持续时间。浮生 · 渡尘之羽装备时，QTE及切换架势也能触发该领域，领域生成时根据自身所处架势立即为领域内敌人附加对应的【羽燃之印】并移除另一架势对应的【羽燃之印】，带有【羽燃之印】的敌人受到对应架势的分支攻击时，【羽燃之印】引爆并造成150.0%攻击力的火焰元素伤害，【羽燃之印】持续5秒。离场时移除领域和所有【羽燃之印】</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">心作琉璃</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">火焰元素伤害提高18.0%。角色最大生命值超过7000点时，全伤害提高14.0%。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"gainMethod\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--gainMethod obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>获取途径</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">补给获取</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">精准补给</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">材料-消耗品</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">开启<a href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/2963/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\" data-type=\"obc-content\" target=\"_blank\">「炽焰丹心」装备自选箱</a>兑换获得</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">大伟哥别墅</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(251, 253, 255)\">消耗</span><a href=\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/bh3/wiki/content/1180/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\" data-type=\"a\" target=\"_blank\">大伟哥黑金卡</a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(251, 253, 255)\">兑换获得</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">作战凭证</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(251, 253, 255)\">第五十二期（V8.4）作战工坊限时兑换</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 3;\"> <div data-part=\"material\" data-tmpl=\"stigmata\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-stigmata obc-tmpl__part--material obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>进化材料</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <thead><tr><th>突破等级</th> <th colspan=\"5\">所需材料</th></tr></thead> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">35</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1132/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">三分结晶</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*3</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1890/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">流体合金块</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/